    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about being \"bedrock.\" it's the total irrelevance of it. i feel like a ghost in my own life. looking at the calendar and seeing years of empty, quiet days ahead... it just feels exhausting. like i'm just waiting for the clock to run out, but the clock is moving so slowly.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
